        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:520px;\">\n  <!-- 왼쪽: 임팩트 숫자 패널 -->\n  <div style=\"flex:0 0 clamp(180px,38%,320px);background:var(--color-coral,#D85A30);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,64px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px);\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;\">추가 수입 목표</p>\n    <p style=\"font-family:'GmarketSans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(56px,9vw,96px);font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1;margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-0.04em;\">500</p>\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Gotham',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">만원 / 월</p>\n    <div style=\"width:40px;height:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:24px 0;\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">콘텐츠 3개로<br>시작했습니다</p>\n  </div>\n  <!-- 오른쪽: 카피 + CTA 패널 -->\n  <div style=\"flex:1 1 320px;background:#1F1F1F;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,64px) clamp(24px,4vw,56px);\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E2E2E;color:#D85A30;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9999px;margin-bottom:24px;width:fit-content;\">AI 콘텐츠 × 1인 사업</span>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'GmarketSans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,42px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#F5EFE0;margin:0 0 20px;\">블로그 하나,<br>유튜브 하나,<br>전자책 하나.<br><span style=\"color:#D85A30;\">이게 다입니다.</span></h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#A0A0A0;max-width:380px;margin:0 0 36px;\">월요일 퇴근 후 2시간. 토요일 오전 3시간.<br>그렇게 석 달이 지났을 때 통장이 달랐습니다.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;\">\n      <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#D85A30;color:#fff;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-decoration:none;\">코스 바로 보기</a>\n      <a href=\"#review\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:14px;color:#6B6B6B;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Gotham',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">★ 4.8</span> 수강생 후기 →</a>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#4A4A4A;margin-top:24px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">30~45세 직장인·프리랜서 1,240명 수강 완료</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
